      "content": "If the math truly doesn't work, then the problem isn't your effort; it's the system you're in. When the burden is that immense, you need to stop trying to solve it with more work. Reaching out to a non-profit credit counselor or a debt management service could provide a map out of this immediate hole. They specialize in restructuring these overwhelming situations.",
